              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lino nilio liliaba lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khu mwami Yehu lili, “Be enju yowo khukhwama luno khukhwola khu selukho eye khane baliba babaami ba Isiraeli.” Liaba ng'ali.",
          "type": "text",
