          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola kamakhumi kataru na tisa kwe bubwami bwo mwami Usia owa Yuda, Menahemu okhwa Kati amiisibwa aba omwami owa Isiraeli. Ne amiia ne ali mu Samaria khulwe kimiiko likhumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola bumayaanu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Mu limenya liewe lioosi se alekhakho bumayaanu bwa Yeroboamu bwoosi nibwo arangirira Isiraeli khukhola tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Puli owa Ashuru ebwaakala Isiraeli mala Menahemu amuelesia chitani eelefu ndala che efwesa nio anyoole buyeeti bwe khutasa kamaani khu Menahemu khukhila sibala. (Omwami Puli lundi alaangwa ali Tikilati Pileseri). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu anyoola chirupia khukhwama khu baandu baiinda ba Isiraeli boosi khulwe busuuru. Buli mulala arusia bitonyi kamakhumi karaano bie efwesa. Nio aelesia Puli omwami owa Ashuru. Nio omwami owa Ashuru akobolayo ne se amenya mu sibala esio tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
