          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola kamakhumi karaano kwe bubwami bwo mwami Usia owa Yuda Pekahia okhwa Menahemu amiisibwa aba omwami owa Isiraeli. Amiia Isiraeli ne ali mu Samaria khulwe kimiiko kibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola bumayaanu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Se alekha bumayaanu bwo mwami Yeroboamu okhwa Nebati nibwo akhola khulwe khurangirira Isiraeli abengisia mu bumayaanu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka okhwa Remalia, omunamae omukhulu owe banamae ba Pekahia, akhola ekwangwaani ne babaasie kamakhumi karaano khukhwama Kileati. Nio bereera Pekahia mwichipi, mukari mwe lisiisi lie lukoba, mu Samaria. Nio amiia ela mu bweyaangu bwa Pekahia aba omwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
