              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola kamakhumi karaano na kibili kwe bubwami bwo mwami Asaria owa Yuda, Peka okhwa Remalia amiisibwa aaba omwami owa Isiraeli. Amiia Isiraeli ne ali mu Samaria khulwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
