          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola bumayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Se alekha bumayaanu bwo mwami Yeroboamu okhwa Nebati, nibwo arangirira Isiraeli khukhola tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.28",
